{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1422832-chantry-common-areas-anonymizing-appearances","id":1422832,"title":"Chantry Common Areas, anonymizing appearances","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-11-09T15:34:01-08:00","id":1422832,"title":"Chantry Common Areas, anonymizing appearances","content":"I have a basic idea of an effect that my chronicle's Chantry would have cast in high traffic areas like the Library. It would be Forces 2, Entropy 3, to begin with, blurring the physical appearances of Mages in the area while allowing to remain distinct. Voices would be similarly affected. It allows social interaction between Mages, while preventing all the lower level members from walking out with memories that identify everyone in the Chantry. It is a bit like VR-avatars, except in physical space. Some degree of Correspondence might be needed to stretch it out, but I don't know how much.<br /> <br /> Thoughts?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-10T00:12:29-08:00","id":1422878,"title":"","content":"My first thought would be:<br /> <br /> 1) How huge is this Chantry that it warrants the 'lower level members' not seeing the higher up faces?<br /> 2) If said lower levels are under such scrutiny, shouldn't they maybe have their own separate library, which cleanly separates the material available to them?<br /> 3) Seriously, how come people who aren't trusted with even seeing faces are allowed in the same Chantry?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://is.gd/wodchart\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Probability Chart</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodcalc\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Statistics Calculator</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodarmor\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Armor System</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Damage Roll System</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage2\" target=\"_blank\">My explanation of cWoD Damage Levels</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodstrength\" target=\"_blank\">'Interesting' Strength Attribute Stuff</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodboom\" target=\"_blank\">EXPLOSIVE cWoD STUFF!</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodheresy\" target=\"_blank\">How Technocrats don't think they are Mages</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","name":"Ambrosia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6606_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-10T01:03:13-08:00","id":1422882,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ambrosia</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1422832-chantry-common-areas-anonymizing-appearances?p=1422878#post1422878\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">1) How huge is this Chantry that it warrants the 'lower level members' not seeing the higher up faces?</div> </div> </div> </div>It is multilocation with portals connecting buildings into one megastructure. Lower members are anonymized to each other, protecting them as well.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ambrosia</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1422832-chantry-common-areas-anonymizing-appearances?p=1422878#post1422878\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">2) If said lower levels are under such scrutiny, shouldn't they maybe have their own separate library, which cleanly separates the material available to them?</div> </div> </div> </div>That doesn't prevent two guest Cabals running into each other.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ambrosia</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1422832-chantry-common-areas-anonymizing-appearances?p=1422878#post1422878\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">3) Seriously, how come people who aren't trusted with even seeing faces are allowed in the same Chantry?</div> </div> </div> </div>It's not a trust issue. It is about Mind-Blind Mages having their memories scanned by MiB's and other enemies. In a Chantry where everyone can socialize with their true appearance, it only takes one pass at line of site with Mind to identify everyone. Such a chantry is doomed, in my view.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-10T03:23:39-08:00","id":1422891,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HorizonParty2021</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">it only takes one pass at line of site with Mind to identify everyone. Such a chantry is doomed, in my view.</div> </div> </div> </div>Dang I really love this concept in general, but this part is kinda overkill. Only someone really invested in (an affinity) or someone with extremely high Mind would be able to do this... Though actually now that I think of it- this makes sense however. Lower ranked members barely have knowledges beyond their affinity Sphere and a few others in a range to 1-3. Not every low-ranked member who doesn't have Mind as an affinity or some dots in it will be able to use Countermagick against an enemy Mage or Technocrat wanting to know the site location the Chantry. Even the acolytes that do will have to get really lucky in Countermagick to begin with to counteract.<br /> <br /> Still I think its overkill, but depending on the local operandi of the Chantry- such a contingual Effect would be necessary; especially when a certain region is under hot contestment between rival Cabals or Technocrats themselves.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Jade Kingdom Warrior","edited":{"userid":25523,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","user":"Shakanaka","date":". 11-10-2020, 06:25 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","name":"Shakanaka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25523_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"951"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-10T09:35:31-08:00","id":1422916,"title":"","content":"Correspondence 3 should do the work. It would be a &quot;ward-like&quot; effect that applies the illusion to people who enter the place. Corr 2 would be enough if you weren't using Entropy 3 - but one needs to adjust the Corr level to the highest Sphere used.<br /> <br /> It's a nice alternative to the classic masks &amp; robes approach, that also covers the voice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","name":"Aleph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3056"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}